ollows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =0 \\\\ \\frac{2x}{5}-3 & =0 \\\\ \\frac{2x}{5} & =3 \\\\ 2x & =15 \\\\ x & =\\frac{15}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the function has the single root $x=\\frac{15}{2}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186570712 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129108 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "578132af-f322-5a68-9771-72e1954622ad" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Roots of a Function Given a Mapping Diagram"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "04cf6ea3-17b2-5656-aadd-31ee597243eb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$1$ and $5$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186570131} {:answer/id #uuid "3571bc28-e74e-5d55-8aa6-2a6f4257692b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$5$ and $9$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186570219} {:answer/id #uuid "44cc5369-62f4-54aa-999a-3eda2c1a86b9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$1$ and $7$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186570244} {:answer/id #uuid "ae0c2df6-ded6-5576-8906-d45461a20e3d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$7$ and $9$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186570436} {:answer/id #uuid "fca1ed30-048a-58b9-9d5a-49c85fba9d73" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$1,$ $5$ and $9$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186570571}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3571bc28-e74e-5d55-8aa6-2a6f4257692b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$5$ and $9$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186570219} :answer-field/id #uuid "0f2f5574-9357-5689-96e5-a251d64ad899" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186570583}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uui